I played this game for a little bit, and about an hour recently. I used to love it, then I heard they were going to re-launch it. I was excited! However, I haven't heard much about it after that. No updates, or anything. If you have friends that want to try something, go for it. It's only $5, not too bad. There are many, many worse games out there for the same price if not more. However if you're playing alone, I couldn't recommend it.
;
;
In the end, as I said earlier if you have some friends and are looking for a distraction for a few then feel free to buy the game. It's more enjoyable with friends than by your lonesome.

