It may have to be run in an 800x600 window on the lowest graphics settings possible, the screen may go black and make me have to reset the graphics whenever a grenade goes off or more than 3 guns are firing at once, and it may turn my GPU into a heater with its 80C temps (
). But I love this game. Fast-paced, strategic gameplay that really makes you feel like a guy with a next-gen nano-suit battling aliens and the military in a post-apocalyptic city scene. I can't wait until I get a real computer and can play through the campaign again this time in full screen.
UPDATE - GTX 750 - temps reduced to half and performance maxed out: This game is beautiful. My only wish is that the campaign was longer.

